# Agents And Skills

Read `AGENTS.md` and `USER_GUIDE.md`. Launch specialists from `.cursor/agents/` instead of playing every role in one chat.

A user-visible change is not done until someone opened the running UI, captured desktop and mobile screenshots, and reviewed those images. Reading TSX is not QA.

Describe the change once. This session launches Planner, then the owner, then QA. Use the `browser-qa` skill for any screen.
